"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2802,"###
 Muhammad bin Yahya narrated to us, saying: Abdullah bin Muhammad Al-Nufayli narrated to us, saying: Hatim bin Isma'il narrated to us, saying: Ja'far narrated to us, from his father, who said: We entered upon Jabir bin Abdullah (RA), and he mentioned the hadith in full length, saying: ""When it was the Day of Tarwiyah, the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) mounted his mount, and he led us in prayer for Dhuhr, Asr,"
